hi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:27:#     - 箭头模板保持粗而不对称，避免与普通斑块或矩形装饰混淆；对角方向继续专用 6x7 形状，避免 5x5 小图里对角箭头难读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:29:#     - 旧 `_legend_directions` 的 `len(counts)==3` 前提已不成立；新图例只有“箭头色 C + 底色 1”两种颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:32:#     - 因此方向解码必须改为“抽取颜色 C 的布尔掩码，并和 5x5 / 6x7 箭头模板匹配”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:36:#     - 箭头图例仍是完整非背景矩形，因此连通域 + bbox=area 的“矩形图例”检测仍有效。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:39:#     - 人类看到输入输出时，能直接看出角落矩形里的墙色 C 画成了某个箭头，而黄色沿该箭头方向滑向区域远端。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88e364bc/D1/0/code.py:42:#     - 图例内部只有“粗箭头 + 简单底板 + 四角点”，不会叠加太多细碎标记。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:9:#    - 本变体把“空框”改成“提示框”：它的内部用保留色 7 画一支 8 向箭头，箭头表示训练对的有向关系，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:11:#    - 具体小例子：若两个同配色训练框分别位于左上和右下，提示框中的箭头若指向右下，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:12:#      则 solver 必须把左上当源、右下当目标；若箭头反向，则应交换两者。原始 solver 会双向尝试再打分，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:13:#      变体 solver 则先读箭头，再只按箭头指定方向推断模板并作用到测试框。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:17:#      （如镜像、自反反色），即使有箭头也不会改变测试输出，会退化回原题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:25:#    - 提示箭头只画在提示框内部，并且保留色 7 不出现在训练/测试精灵、边框和背景中，避免识别冲突。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:27:#    - 人类看到样例时，可以先注意到唯一的保留色箭头，再观察它指向哪一个训练框。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/4c7dc4dd/D19/2/code.py:30:#    - 箭头只占提示框内部，不叠加到其他对象上；背景和边框颜色与提示色、精灵色相互避让。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/30/code.py:16:#      A 只有细尾巴；B 同时有箭头头部且导线从其两侧穿过；C 只有终点箭头头部。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/30/code.py:46:#    - 中间带箭头且导线继续穿过的节点对应 bridge；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/30/code.py:47:#    - 终点箭头对应 final target。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/17/code.py:3:# Name: 带对角标记的精灵+方向箭头标记\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/8/code.py:3:# Name: 统一轴向射线+形状决定距离+箭头精灵\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/10/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头精灵+方向由最近边缘决定\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/10/code.py:206:    Key insight: The arrowhead is a red herring. Shape tells you where the shot starts, but the shot direction comes from the sprite's global position relative to the border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/37/code.py:52:#    - The countable colors are signposted only by palette overlap with the relevant lower quadrant,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头标记编码方向+L/T形模板\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:19:# - Fused task: the source is now a 3-cell arrowhead whose geometry fixes the first\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:28:# - Markers use only four unambiguous arrowhead shapes `> < ^ v`; this keeps the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:68:#   exactly one arrowhead orientation.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:110:    \"\"\"Return (tip_r, tip_c, direction) for a 3-cell arrowhead component.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:295:    - Start markers are 3-cell arrowheads in template colors, embedded inside the path region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/10/code.py:300:    - Each arrow launches one particle from its tip in the direction encoded by the arrowhead shape.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/21/code.py:3:# Name: 图例顺序编码方向加箭头图例\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:255:    \"name\": \"图例顺序编码方向加箭头图例\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:448:    \"name\": \"箭头图例双参数编码可变角度\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:3:# Name: 符号转向指令+箭头标记+模板方向符号\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:22:# - Replace the old single-pixel sources with 3-cell arrowheads in the first cycle\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:27:# - Fusion choice for the D4/D11 tension: every arrowhead must point in the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:30:#   `v` arrowheads, motion starts downward; if the turn bars read [L,R,R], later\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:46:#   replaced by 8-connected size-3 arrowhead decoding.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:48:#   new symbolic cues, so the solver now decodes the arrowheads and template glyph\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:73:#   glyph stay in the top-left template region, while arrowheads stay inside the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:446:    - Start markers are 3-cell arrowheads in the first cycle color, embedded inside the path band, and a separate 2x2 block provides the terminal collision color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/22/code.py:455:    - The template now carries two independent symbolic programs at once: block colors specify the repaint cycle, and instruction marks specify both the shared launch heading and the collision-turn schedule, while the arrowheads localize the actual start tips and confirm the heading geometrically.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/36/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头图例双参数编码可变角度\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D6/2/code.py:3:# Change: 一对蓝色像素——两个孤立的蓝色像素定义对角线的起点和终点... → 箭头形状指示方向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/7/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头头部对准目标点\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/271d71e2/21/code.py:3:# Name: 内部图案决定方向加箭头头部\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D10/0/code.py:10:#     - 精灵色：一个三角/箭头模板，颜色在整题内保持一致。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/21/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头标记与镜像\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/21/code.py:408:    - Color 1 now forms 5-cell arrows instead of T tetromi